div.p:
The Justices of the Peace personnel shall include: 

One judge only;

A clerk;

One or more sworn interpreters.

The Central Tribunal will be composed as follows: (1)
One President and two Judges; all three to be nominated by the General, Commander-in-Chief, on the recommendation of the Governor General, and chosen from among the local population; but to be of different nationalities; (2)
One Chief Clerk of the Court and one or more interpreters, nominated by the Governor;
